# input, leave the Logs text-entry screen, or render the data-viz widgets.
#
# Stable, tick-counter-independent literals: the header brand, the navigated
# screen title, a static panel title the Metrics widgets always render, and
# the footer hint (same marker class as kitchen-sink-smoke.expect).
rstui
